，个体化幅度。\",\n      \"task\": \"标准化115米真实步行课程。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"6个可穿戴运动学传感器，双踝、双腕、下背部及胸部。\",\n      \"measure\": \"相对冻结时间（总冻结时间/总步行时间）。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"运动学128 Hz；freeze band 3–8 Hz，locomotion band 0.5–3 Hz。\",\n      \"finding\": \"cDBS条件下相对冻结时间均值为0.0011±0.0036，中位数0，IQR 0。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"三条件Friedman ANOVA：χ²=3.000，p=0.223；总体差异未达到显著。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级重复测量；n=11；Friedman ANOVA。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"RoB 2（随机交叉试验；客观步态结局）\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"随机化过程\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"随机顺序报告，但序列生成及分配隐藏细节不足。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol and experimental setup\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"偏离预期干预\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"刺激条件间隔可能不足以排除步态反应残留。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Discussion—limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"结局数据缺失\",\n            \"judgement\": \"high\",\n            \"reason\": \"4/15患者无法完成全部客观步态条件。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—Behavioral results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"结局测量\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"运动学阈值结合视频人工修正，未报告独立评审一致性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Kinematic recordings and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未核实完整预设分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"high\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"cDBS条件下描述性相对冻结时间最低，但三条件总体检验不显著。\",\n      \"quote\": \"relative freezing time [ratio]\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—Behavioral results\",\n        \"page\": null,\n  