        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"DUTKE2025_EEG_FREEZING_VS_WALKING\",\n      \"design\": \"随机双盲DBS干预研究中的探索性皮层EEG事件状态分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"15名PD患者；所有患者FoG-Q报告有FoG。实际进入冻结事件EEG比较的有效患者人数未单独报告。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 24,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"全文明确报告进行了regular walking与freezing episodes比较，但没有给出该探索性比较的患者数、有效冻结事件数或各条件epoch数量。24为头皮EEG通道数，不是STN触点数。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"A_actual_natural\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"during_FOG\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"实际步行课程中的FoG事件；使用3–8 Hz freeze band识别，akinetic freezing通过视觉检查、书面记录及视频修正；具体亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"常规多巴胺能药物，Med-On/usual medication；剂量及时间未报告。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"研究包括OFF-DBS、cDBS及TBS-DBS。方法称各DBS条件均计算运动状态功率谱，但冻结与正常步行比较的条件特异结果未单独报告。\",\n      \"task\": \"标准化真实直立步行课程；比较regular walking与freezing episodes。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"24通道移动式头皮EEG；额部Fz、F3、F4及中央Cz、C3、C4等皮层电极。没有STN-LFP记录。\",\n      \"measure\": \"冻结事件与正常步行期间的皮层EEG频谱功率差异；whole-cortex cluster-based permutation analysis。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"1秒不重叠epoch；FFT频谱2–45 Hz，1 Hz分辨率，±2 Hz smoothing；自然对数功率。delta 1–3 Hz、theta 4–8 Hz、alpha 9–13 Hz、low-beta 14–20 Hz、high-beta 21–30 Hz、gamma 31–45 Hz。gamma因步行肌电伪迹未纳入。5000次Monte Carlo permutation；至少两个相邻通道形成显著cluster，阈值p<0.05。\",\n      \"finding\": \"探索性比较regular walking与freezing episodes时，没有发现显著皮层EEG功率变化cluster。该研究没有报告冻结前事件相关的STN神经信号变化。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"No significant clusters found。未报告具体cluster统计量、效应量、95% CI或事件级p值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"1秒epoch频谱先进行患者级平均；随后采用Monte Carlo cluster-based permutation test。冻结事件数及各患者有效epoch数量未报告，不能将epoch数量当作独立患者数。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated（观察性电生理/事件关联分析领域级初评，非正式验证工具）\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心、小样本；研究入组要求是步态障碍，不强制要求FOG；事件级EEG有效患者分母未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants; Results—Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用3–8 Hz freeze band识别并人工检查akinetic freezing，但未报告独立盲法裁定或评审者间一致性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Kinematic recordings and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"进行了DBS谐波去伪迹、ASR、ICA及DIPFIT处理，但作者明确承认残余伪迹不能完全排除。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG recordings and analysis; Discussion—limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者均使用常规药物；运动状态与肌电、运动伪迹及刺激条件可能共同影响EEG。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants; Discussion—limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用1秒epoch并报告患者级平均，但冻结事件数及各患者有效epoch数量未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG recordings and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用5000次cluster permutation降低多重比较问题，但多个频段和探索性比较的跨分析校正情况不明确。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告预测模型；不存在可评估的外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未核实预注册或完整预设EEG分析计划；该比较明确为探索性分析。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—EEG results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是本文与FOG事件最直接相关的EEG分析，但结果为阴性。记录位置是头皮皮层，不是STN；事件数及有效神经数据患者数不清楚；未提供pre-FOG事件窗口，不能检验冻结前STN beta升高机制。阴性结果也不能证明STN不存在相关活动。\",\n      \"quote\": \"between regular walking and freezing episodes where no significant clusters were found\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—EEG results; exploratory analysis of regular walking and freezing episodes\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": null,\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"DUTKE2025_EEG_FRONTAL_LOW_BETA\",\n      \"design\": \"随机双盲刺激研究中的患者级移动EEG频谱分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"15名PD患者；所有患者报告FoG-Q阳性。Figure 4报告全部PD患者的frontal ROI分析。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 15,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 15,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 15,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 24,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"Figure 4说明分析全部PD患者。该EEG比较对应无FoG的直线规则步行，不存在可提取的事件级冻结总数。24为头皮EEG通道数。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"non_event_gait\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"患者FoG-Q报告FoG，但本项EEG分析明确采用straight regular gait without FoG episodes；具体FOG亚型未报告。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"常规多巴胺能药物，Med-On/usual medication。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"OFF-DBS、cDBS及TBS-DBS。cDBS为130 Hz、60 μs；TBS为5 Hz interburst、200 Hz intraburst、60 μs及TEED调整幅度。\",\n      \"task\": \"30秒坐姿睁眼resting-like状态与straight regular walking比较；分析无FoG步行。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"24通道头皮EEG；frontal ROI为Fz、F3、F4，代表premotor cortex。\",\n      \"measure\": \"Frontal ROI低beta频段运动诱发功率抑制（movement-induced low-beta suppression）。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"low-beta 14–20 Hz；1秒不重叠epoch；2–45 Hz频谱、1 Hz分辨率、±2 Hz smoothing；自然对数功率；以30秒坐姿睁眼状态作为resting-like基线；患者级平均。\",\n      \"finding\": \"TBS-DBS下frontal low-beta抑制在数值上比cDBS更强，但没有达到统计学显著。各DBS条件下频段功率幅值也未发现显著差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"TBS-DBS vs cDBS：p=0.250；TBS-DBS vs OFF-DBS：p=0.160；cDBS vs OFF-DBS：p=0.570。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级频谱平均；Figure 4报告全部PD患者。正文未明确给出这三个ROI两两比较的具体检验名称；whole-cortex分析另采用5000次cluster permutation。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated（观察性电生理/机制分析领域级初评）\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心15人，14男1女，且所有人有慢性双侧STN-DBS。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants; Results—Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"该分析限定为无FoG的规则直线步行，行为状态定义清楚，但不能代表实际冻结事件。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Figure 2 caption; EEG results\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"进行了多种伪迹去除，但作者承认仍不能完全排除残余EEG伪迹。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG recordings and analysis; Discussion—limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"常规药物状态、运动伪迹及刺激参数可能影响皮层EEG；药物时间和剂量未完整报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants; Discussion—limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者级平均降低了epoch伪重复风险，但具体有效epoch数量未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG recordings and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用cluster permutation，但跨频段及不同刺激比较的整体校正不完全明确。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"没有预测模型或外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未核实预注册和预设EEG分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG analysis\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是皮层运动诱发低beta抑制，不是STN-LFP beta。分析的是没有冻结的规则步行，不能证明该信号与实际FOG事件存在时间关联。TBS与cDBS的直接差异p=0.250，不显著。\",\n      \"quote\": \"TBS-DBS showed a stronger low beta suppression than cDBS, although it was not statistically significant\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—EEG results\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 2; Figure 4\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"DUTKE2025_EEG_LOW_BETA_TOPOGRAPHY\",\n      \"design\": \"随机双盲刺激研究中的探索性头皮EEG拓扑分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"15名PD患者；Figure 3注明结果为全部PD患者平均。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 15,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 15,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 15,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 24,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"分析全部PD患者的静息样与行走状态差异；该分析没有事件级FOG冻结总数。24为头皮EEG电极数。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"non_event_gait\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"患者FoG-Q阳性；此项比较为静息样状态与无FoG规则步行，不是冻结事件。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"常规多巴胺能药物，Med-On/usual medication。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"cDBS：130 Hz、60 μs；TBS-DBS：5 Hz interburst、200 Hz intraburst、60 μs，TEED调整幅度。\",\n      \"task\": \"resting-like与walking比较；直线规则步行，无FoG事件。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"24通道头皮EEG；全头皮拓扑分析，涉及motor及premotor cortex。\",\n      \"measure\": \"低beta频段14–20 Hz运动诱发功率抑制的空间拓扑分布。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"低beta 14–20 Hz；1秒不重叠epoch；2–45 Hz频谱；1 Hz分辨率、±2 Hz smoothing；resting-like为30秒坐姿睁眼基线；5000次cluster permutation。\",\n      \"finding\": \"cDBS条件下低beta抑制主要位于motor cortex上方；TBS-DBS条件下低beta抑制还扩展至premotor cortex上方。作者将两种刺激模式的拓扑差异描述为定性视觉比较。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"Figure 3定性拓扑差异；未报告TBS-DBS与cDBS之间直接空间差异的独立p值或效应量。各刺激条件相对于resting-like的部分cluster达到显著。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级平均功率变化；whole-cortex Monte Carlo cluster-based permutation，5000次置换；显著cluster定义为至少两个相邻通道且p<0.05。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated（观察性电生理/机制分析领域级初评）\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心小样本，14/15为男性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"该分析是无FoG规则步行与坐姿resting-like比较，不是事件级冻结标签。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Figure 2 caption; EEG recordings and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"虽然使用多种去伪迹算法，作者仍承认残余伪迹可能存在。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG recordings and analysis; Discussion\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"药物、步行运动伪迹及刺激模式可能共同影响EEG。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants; Discussion—limitations\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者级平均有助于控制伪重复，但有效epoch数量未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG recordings and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用cluster permutation，但跨频段与刺激条件的整体校正细节不足。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"无预测模型或外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未核实预设拓扑分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG analysis; Results—Figure 3\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"该发现属于头皮皮层低beta空间分布变化，不是STN低beta活动。不同刺激条件的拓扑差异主要为定性比较，不能等同于显著的FOG事件相关神经变化。\",\n      \"quote\": \"low-beta suppression in the TBS-DBS condition was additionally localized above the premotor cortex\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—EEG results; TBS-DBS and cDBS showed slightly different patterns of movement-induced alpha- and beta-suppression\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 3\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"DUTKE2025_EEG_ALPHA_TOPOGRAPHY\",\n      \"design\": \"随机双盲刺激研究中的探索性头皮EEG拓扑分析。\",\n      \"population\": \"15名PD患者；Figure 3报告全部PD患者平均结果。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 15,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 15,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": 15,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 24,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"全部PD患者的resting-like与walking状态比较；未报告事件级冻结数量。24为头皮EEG通道数。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"non_event_gait\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"所有患者FoG-Q阳性；本项分析为无FoG规则步行，未分析实际冻结事件。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"常规多巴胺能药物，Med-On/usual medication。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"cDBS：130 Hz、60 μs；TBS-DBS：5 Hz interburst、200 Hz intraburst、60 μs。\",\n      \"task\": \"resting-like坐姿睁眼与规则直线步行比较。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"24通道头皮EEG；motor及premotor cortical scalp topography。\",\n      \"measure\": \"alpha频段运动诱发功率抑制的空间拓扑分布。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"alpha 9–13 Hz；1秒不重叠epoch；resting-like为30秒坐姿睁眼；患者级平均功率变化；5000次cluster permutation。\",\n      \"finding\": \"alpha抑制的拓扑模式与低beta相反：TBS-DBS条件下alpha抑制主要位于motor cortex上方；cDBS条件下则位于motor及premotor cortex上方。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"Figure 3定性拓扑比较；未报告两种刺激模式之间直接拓扑差异的独立效应量或p值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级功率平均；Monte Carlo cluster-based permutation test，5000次置换；至少两个相邻通道且p<0.05定义为显著cluster。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated（观察性电生理/机制分析领域级初评）\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心小样本，14/15男性。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—Participants\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用无FoG规则步行，不是事件级FOG分析。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Figure 2 caption; Methods—EEG analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"进行了EEG伪迹处理，但残余运动及刺激伪迹不能完全排除。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG recordings and analysis; Discussion\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"常规药物状态、运动及DBS刺激均可能影响alpha功率。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants; Discussion\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者级平均降低伪重复风险，但epoch数量未报告。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG recordings and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用cluster permutation，但多频段及多条件跨分析校正不明确。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"未进行预测建模。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未核实预设alpha拓扑分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—EEG results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"alpha拓扑差异属于皮层运动相关信号，且没有实际FOG事件对应分析。不能把alpha空间分布差异等同于STN alpha活动或FOG病理机制。\",\n      \"quote\": \"Alpha suppression in the TBS-DBS condition was predominantly localized above the motor cortex\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—EEG results\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 3\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"eid_local\": \"DUTKE2025_EEG_PREFERENCE_GROUP_COMPARISON\",\n      \"design\": \"随机双盲刺激研究中的探索性患者偏好组皮层EEG比较。\",\n      \"population\": \"15名PD患者；TBS-preference组7人，Non-TBS-preference组8人。EEG分析的独立有效数据人数未单独列出。\",\n      \"n_enrolled\": 15,\n      \"n_analyzed\": 15,\n      \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 15,\n      \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n      \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n      \"n_trials\": null,\n      \"n_electrodes_contacts\": 24,\n      \"missing_reason\": \"偏好分组在全部15名患者中完成；EEG有效记录人数未单独报告。临床FoG-Course完整病例分析使用11人，不能将该11人分母直接替代EEG分析分母。\",\n      \"endpoint_class\": \"E_questionnaire_rest\",\n      \"event_phase\": \"non_event_gait\",\n      \"freezing_phenotype\": \"所有15人FoG-Q阳性；偏好组依据患者对TBS-DBS与cDBS的主观步态及FOG评价形成。此项EEG比较使用resting-like与walking状态，没有事件级冻结关联。\",\n      \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n      \"experimental_medication_state\": \"常规多巴胺能药物，Med-On/usual medication。\",\n      \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"比较TBS-preference与Non-TBS-preference患者在不同DBS条件下的皮层EEG变化；cDBS 130 Hz、60 μs；TBS 5 Hz interburst、200 Hz intraburst、60 μs。\",\n      \"task\": \"30秒坐姿睁眼resting-like与步行状态比较；患者偏好组间比较。\",\n      \"recording_location\": \"24通道移动式头皮EEG；frontal ROI Fz、F3、F4；central ROI Cz、C3、C4。\",\n      \"measure\": \"患者偏好组之间的运动诱发皮层EEG功率变化。\",\n      \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"1秒不重叠epoch；2–45 Hz；alpha 9–13 Hz、low-beta 14–20 Hz、high-beta 21–30 Hz等；患者级平均；5000次Monte Carlo cluster permutation。\",\n      \"finding\": \"TBS-preference组与Non-TBS-preference组之间的resting-like至walking皮层活动变化没有显著cluster；line plots也未显示明显组间差异。\",\n      \"effect_estimate\": \"未发现显著cluster；未报告组间具体效应量或p值。\",\n      \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者级组间EEG比较；Monte Carlo cluster-based permutation test，5000次置换；显著cluster定义为至少两个相邻通道且p<0.05。\",\n      \"risk_of_bias\": {\n        \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated（观察性电生理/探索性亚组分析领域级初评）\",\n        \"domains\": [\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"单中心小样本，患者偏好组为主观分类；完整临床病例仅11人。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Results—The TBS-preference subgroup showed specific improvement of FoG\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"偏好组反映主观治疗评价，不是客观冻结事件标签。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Protocol and experimental setup\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"信号质量及伪迹\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"使用多种伪迹处理方法，但作者不能排除残余EEG伪迹。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG recordings and analysis; Discussion\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"混杂因素\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"偏好组不是随机形成的生理亚组；药物、临床差异及刺激参数可能影响组间比较。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Participants; Results—Table 3\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"重复测量及伪重复\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"患者级平均功率降低伪重复风险，但有效epoch和患者级完整数据分母未明确。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG recordings and analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n            \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n            \"reason\": \"采用5000次cluster permutation，但多频段、多通道及多条件的跨分析校正不明确。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"模型过拟合及外部验证\",\n            \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n            \"reason\": \"未报告预测模型或外部验证。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—Statistical analysis\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n            \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n            \"reason\": \"未核实预注册和预设亚组EEG分析计划。\",\n            \"source_locator\": \"Methods—EEG analysis; Results—EEG results\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n      },\n      \"limitations\": \"这是重要的阴性结果：患者主观感受到TBS-DBS获益的亚组，没有显示相应的静息至步行皮层EEG差异。该结果不能排除STN局部活动差异，因为本研究未记录STN-LFP，且分析不是实际冻结事件级比较。\",\n      \"quote\": \"did not reveal any significant clusters\",\n      \"source_locator\": {\n        \"section\": \"Results—The TBS-preference and Non-TBS-preference group did not show different cortical activity patterns\",\n        \"page\": null,\n        \"figure_table\": \"Figure 5\",\n        \"supplement\": null\n      },\n      \"basis\": \"fulltext\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b8c72dbf-e251-4